{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>For this time.</b> In this third category of plagues — those in the air." "<b>I am sending all my plagues to your heart and to your servants and to your people.</b> Each one of these that I shall send will be felt in the heart of you all even after it departs, for even afterward you will experience harm drawn from it — through the corruption of vegetation and food supplies and through bodily illness — as with the plague of darkness, which corrupted the quality of the air without doubt, so that no man rose from under it, having been afflicted by dreadful diseases without doubt. But from the preceding plagues no evident harm lingered after they departed." "<b>To the end that you may know that there is none like Me in all the earth.</b> When you see that I have power even in the surrounding air. Indeed, the power of the supernal beings He made known at the Sea of Reeds through the angel of Elohim and the pillar of cloud and the pillar of fire — all of which are things whose existence is non-natural."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:55.059936640Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}